> > > where is Fort Ludious?

In a vault in a certain range of levels.  You'll need to know how to
tell if a level has vaults and how to find them.

> > Fort Ludious does not exist in every game.
>
> I thought that Ludious existed in every game, and that it was just a 
> question of if you could get into it or not in any particular game.

Semantics.  The code to generate Ludios exists in every game.  The
data structure for it exists in every game.  But like all levels it
is actually generated in detail the first time you enter it.  If none
of the vaults in the range of levels randomly generates a portal, it
can never be created in that game.  Once the portal is generated, you
still need to go there for it to be generated.

